# Environment. Every variant, then the template back in by name — the config
# layer reads `.env` and `.env.local`, but a `.env.production` or `.env.staging`
# holding real API keys and FIELD_ENCRYPTION_KEYS is just as easy to create and
# was not covered before the Epic 07 hardening pass.
.env
.env.*
!.env.example

